  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">About</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>BSG put fake “shadow cubes” inside every interior to compensate for non-existing GI.<br />\nThis mod gives you ability to tweak opacity of those interior shadows.<br />\nIn game press F12 and select mod to tweak settings.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/7Bpencil/SPT-ReduceFakeInteriorShadow/refs/heads/master/preview/preview_1.png\" alt=\"Preview\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/7Bpencil/SPT-ReduceFakeInteriorShadow/refs/heads/master/preview/preview_0.png\" alt=\"Preview\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Videos</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"vhwed0I2r7E\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/vhwed0I2r7E?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vhwed0I2r7E/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"jhVJkcdYPXU\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jhVJkcdYPXU?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jhVJkcdYPXU/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></div></div></div>\n",
